#
# Mach-O exported-symbols list (audit B2).  Mach-O symbols carry a leading
# underscore, so AMA's ama_* ABI is _ama_*.  Everything not matched here is
# hidden from the dylib's export table.
#
# macOS already resolves symbols through a two-level namespace, so the ELF
# flat-namespace interposition hazard the version script addresses does not
# apply to the .dylib; this list restricts the export surface for parity with
# the Linux .so so the un-prefixed vendor names are not published either.
_ama_*
